        "short_description": "Vibe.co is the all-in-one self-serve platform built for performance marketers who want to turn Streaming TV into a true growth channel. Trusted by over 10,000+ performance-driven brands, Vibe brings digital precision, transparency, and measurable ROI to Connected TV advertising.\n\nDesigned for results, not impressions, Vibe helps advertisers drive real performance across metrics like CPA, ROAS, and conversions. Powered by proprietary transactional data, Vibe delivers hyper-targeted TV campaigns with the same accuracy and personalization you expect from Instagram ads—but on the biggest screen in the home.\n\nVibe gives marketers seamless access to the entire streaming TV ecosystem through one simple, intuitive interface. No agencies, no delays, no middlemen. Just full control, instant activation, and performance you can measure.\n\nIntegrated with leading marketing tools like Klaviyo, Segment, HubSpot, Triple Whale, and Northbeam, Vibe connects your customer data to TV in real time for smarter attribution and optimization.\n\nBacked by $80M in funding, Vibe is redefining how modern marketers scale with TV, turning a traditional brand channel into a high-performing, self-serve growth engine.\n\nGet started today on https://vibe.co",
